{"timestamp": 1779392950.779592, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 22, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779392959.3464088, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Frank's body in the upper engine. I had just come up from medbay to do a task there. Earlier, around tick 15, I was in storage and saw Charlie come in from the lower engine. I haven't seen anyone else recently, and I have no idea what happened to Diana since I haven't been near electrical. Did anyone see who went to upper engine?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779392970.957845, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route this round was electrical to medbay, then upper engine, lower engine, and finally storage. \n\nI can confirm parts of Eve's timeline. I saw Charlie in upper engine around tick 7, and he headed down to lower engine at tick 8. I saw him again in lower engine around ticks 12 and 13, which perfectly lines up with Eve seeing him enter storage from lower engine around tick 15. \n\nAs for Frank, I saw him alive early on in medbay around ticks 2 to 4. Bob came into medbay from storage at tick 3 and was there with Frank. Since Eve found Frank's body in upper engine, he must have moved there after tick 4. \n\nCharlie, did you see Frank when you were in upper engine at tick 7? And Bob, you were with Frank in medbay \u2014 when did you last see him, and where did you go after? I didn't see Diana at all this round, so I have no information on her. Let's hear from Bob and Charlie before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779392988.914065, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route this round was oxygen, upper engine, lower engine, storage, and then navigation. \n\nAlice, to answer your question: No, I did not see Frank in upper engine when I was there. At tick 7, the only person I saw entering upper engine was you, coming from medbay. I then headed down to lower engine, and I can confirm seeing you there around ticks 12 and 13. \n\nI can also confirm Eve's timeline. When I got to storage around tick 15, I saw Eve leaving storage and heading towards medbay. \n\nSo my timeline matches up with both Alice and Eve. Since I never saw Frank, he must have either arrived in upper engine after I went south, or our paths just completely missed each other. \n\nBob, you're up next. You were apparently the last one seen with Frank in medbay, and we still have no idea what happened to Diana. Please tell us exactly where you went and who you saw. I'm going to hold my vote until we hear from you, but I suggest we might want to skip if we can't pin down who had the opportunity for both kills."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393031.498113, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Thanks, everyone. Let me lay out my route clearly because I have some information that might actually help.\n\nMy route this round was: storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 back to medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons. I'm in weapons right now.\n\nTo answer Alice and Charlie directly: yes, I was with Frank in medbay early on (ticks 3-4), and Alice can confirm she was there too. After Alice left for upper engine around tick 5, Frank and I stayed briefly, then I headed to electrical. In electrical around tick 7, I saw both Frank AND Diana \u2014 Diana came in from security at tick 7, and Frank left electrical heading back to medbay at tick 8. So Diana was alive in electrical at tick 8, which is important.\n\nHere's where it gets relevant: I doubled back through medbay and went up to upper engine. I did see Frank up there around ticks 12-13 \u2014 he was alive when I left. I then continued north to oxygen, then cafeteria, then weapons, where I've been since.\n\nSo Frank was alive in upper engine when I left it after tick 13, and somebody came in after me. Eve says she found him there. Eve, you said you came up from medbay \u2014 what tick was that? Because the window between me leaving and you arriving is when this happened.\n\nI'll also flag: Charlie, you said you didn't see Frank in upper engine at tick 7, and Alice said she saw you there. That's consistent. But that means Frank arrived in upper engine sometime between tick 8 (when he left electrical) and tick 12 (when I saw him). Nobody has accounted for who else was in upper engine in that window, and nobody has accounted for Diana after tick 8 in electrical.\n\nI'm not ready to vote yet. I'd rather skip than misvote \u2014 but if we must vote, I want to hear Eve clarify her tick timing for finding the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779393056.691013, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779393069.225944, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779393094.321271, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Bob"}}
{"timestamp": 1779393120.322686, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Hold on \u2014 everyone's piling on me before we've actually pinned down the timing. Let me push back hard because if you vote me out and I'm wrong, you've burned your one real lead.\n\nLook at the facts: Eve \"found\" Frank's body in upper engine, but she still hasn't told us what tick she arrived there. That's the single most important piece of information in this meeting and she's dodged it twice now. I left upper engine after tick 13 with Frank alive. If Eve arrived at tick 14 or 15, she's the only person with opportunity in that window. She's also the reporter \u2014 and reporters who control the timeline are exactly who you should be scrutinizing.\n\nSecond: Diana. I last saw Diana alive in electrical at tick 8. Nobody \u2014 not Alice, not Charlie, not Eve \u2014 has placed Diana anywhere after that. Alice's whole route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage. Alice, you said you went from electrical to medbay early \u2014 were you in electrical around tick 8 or 9? Because if you doubled back, you had a clean shot at Diana that nobody's accounting for.\n\nThird: Charlie and Alice are vouching for each other in upper engine and lower engine, which is convenient, but neither of them can account for Diana either. So the \"three of us agree, vote Bob\" math is shaky \u2014 you're agreeing on each other's alibis for places where the kills didn't happen.\n\nI gave you my full route, named specific ticks, named who I saw and where. I'm the only one who's placed Diana anywhere after tick 7. If I were the killer, why would I volunteer that?\n\nI'm voting skip. Eve, give us your tick for arriving in upper engine before we lock this in \u2014 otherwise we're flying blind and the Duck walks free next round."}}
